Tasks
Task 1: React Registration Form (25 points)

Build a RegisterForm component with client-side validation and API integration:

    Fields: Full Name, Email, Password, Confirm Password
    Client-side validation before submitting:
        Name is required and at least 2 characters
        Email is required and has a valid format
        Password is at least 8 characters, contains one uppercase letter and one number
        Confirm Password matches Password
    Display validation errors below the relevant field in red
    On submit, POST to http://localhost:4000/api/auth/register with { email, password, name }
    Show a loading/disabled state on the submit button while the request is in flight
    On success (201): store the returned token and user data, show a success message
    On API error (409 duplicate email, 400 validation error): display the error message from the API response

